        69.16120147705078,
        441.48907470703125,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "are in contact with a person known to have resistance to TB drugs; or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        526.9480590820312,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "reside in settings or belong to subgroups where there is a high probability of resistance",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        84.69419860839844,
        93.1460952758789,
        98.71920013427734
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "SourceSansPro-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.9437866210938,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "to either rifampicin, isoniazid or fluoroquinolone (used in new shorter regimens), or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.9609985351562,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "where there is a high prevalence of   strains harbouring mutations not  M. tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        298.9700012207031,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "detected by other rapid molecular tests.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        149.49591064453125,
        78.81909942626953,
        162.6409149169922
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        149.49591064453125,
        526.9094848632812,
        162.6409149169922
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation is conditional because of the lack of data on health benefits, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        164.99591064453125,
        526.8576049804688,
        178.1409149169922
      ],
      "text": "variable certainty of evidence on diagnostic accuracy, and the fact that accuracy is suboptimal",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        180.49591064453125,
        526.8748779296875,
        193.6409149169922
      ],
      "text": "for certain drugs. In addition, because this is a new technology that has not yet been widely",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.992597579956055,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        195.99591064453125,
        526.936767578125,
        209.1409149169922
      ],
      "text": "implemented, there is still limited and variable evidence on costs, cost–effectiveness and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        211.49591064453125,
        228.89596557617188,
        224.6409149169922
      ],
      "text": "feasibility of implementation.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41439819335938,
        250.3365020751953,
        512.3309936523438,
        263.25048828125
      ],
      "text": "18.\tIn people with bacteriologically confirmed rifampicin-resistant pulmonary",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        265.83648681640625,
        512.2787475585938,
        278.75048828125
      ],
      "text": "TB disease, targeted NGS technologies may be used on respiratory samples",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        281.33648681640625,
        512.361572265625,
        294.25048828125
      ],
      "text": "to diagnose resistance to isoniazid, fluoroquinolones, bedaquiline, linezolid,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        296.83648681640625,
        512.1548461914062,
        309.75048828125
      ],
      "text": "clofazimine, pyrazinamide, ethambutol, amikacin and streptomycin rather than",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 10.958120346069336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        312.33648681640625,
        383.8539123535156,
        325.25048828125
      ],
      "text": "culture-based phenotypic drug susceptibility testing.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        330.7042236328125,
        512.388427734375,
        343.585205078125
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, certainty of evidence high [isoniazid, fluoroquinolones",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 10.973016738891602,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        346.2042236328125,
        512.1646728515625,
        359.085205078125
      ],
      "text": "and pyrazinamide], moderate [ethambutol], low [bedaquiline, linezolid, clofazimine",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        361.7042236328125,
        294.6989440917969,
        374.585205078125
      ],
      "text": "and streptomycin], very low [amikacin])",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        397.01702880859375,
        120.02182006835938,
        411.1050109863281
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        421.8080139160156,
        78.81920623779297,
        434.9530334472656
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        421.8080139160156,
        526.9664916992188,
        434.9530334472656
      ],
      "text": "Priority should be given to those at a higher risk of resistance to medications used for the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        437.3080139160156,
        312.1748962402344,
        450.4530334472656
      ],
      "text": "treatment of RR-TB, including individuals who:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        452.8080139160156,
        95.91820526123047,
        465.9530334472656
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        452.8080139160156,
        527.0250244140625,
        465.9530334472656
      ],
      "text": "continue to be smear or culture positive after 2 months or more of treatment or have",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        468.3080139160156,
        253.30987548828125,
        481.4530334472656
      ],
      "text": "experienced treatment failure;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        483.8080139160156,
        95.91820526123047,
        496.9530334472656
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        483.8080139160156,
        501.048095703125,
        496.9530334472656
      ],
      "text": "have previously had TB treatment, including with the new and repurposed drugs;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        499.3080139160156,
        95.91820526123047,
        512.4530029296875
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        499.3080139160156,
        526.9590454101562,
        512.4530029296875
      ],
      "text": "are in contact with a person known to have resistance to TB drugs, including the new",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        514.8079833984375,
        228.68319702148438,
        527.9530029296875
      ],
      "text": "and repurposed drugs; or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86620330810547,
        530.3079833984375,
        365.78411865234375,
        543.4530029296875
      ],
      "text": "have pre-XDR-TB with resistance to fluoroquinolones.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86620330810547,
        530.3410034179688,
        93.14620208740234,
        544.365966796875
      ],
      "text": "–",
      "font": "SourceSansPro-Regular",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        545.8079833984375,
        78.81920623779297,
        558.9530029296875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        545.8079833984375,
        527.2174072265625,
        558.9530029296875
      ],
      "text": "As above, this recommendation is conditional because of the lack of data on health benefits,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.96534538269043,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        561.3079833984375,
        527.2657470703125,
        574.4530029296875
      ],
      "text": "the variable certainty of evidence on diagnostic accuracy, the fact that accuracy is suboptimal",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.9501371383667,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        576.8079833984375,
        527.1235961914062,
        589.9530029296875
      ],
      "text": "for certain drugs, and limited and variable evidence on costs, cost–effectiveness and feasibility",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        592.3079833984375,
        179.7491912841797,
        605.4530029296875
      ],
      "text": "of implementation.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
